{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an astronomer  in The Observatory; a short 3D first-person cosmic horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work through the night shift  each week, capturing images of space phenomena through a high powered telescope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Name and document your discoveries and come to regret your profession,   <br> as you soon realize space isn't as empty as they say.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836910/extras/f7fbeb042a1d25006492e11e6ea4e9d6.poster.avif?t=1760025509\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836910/extras/f7fbeb042a1d25006492e11e6ea4e9d6.webm?t=1760025509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836910/extras/f7fbeb042a1d25006492e11e6ea4e9d6.mp4?t=1760025509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short Cosmic Horror game inspired by H.P Lovecraft and Junji Ito stories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Megalophobia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden secrets and easter eggs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtrack</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836910/extras/76611c0f3cb81cc5901ec8f374837508.avif?t=1760025509\" width=910 height=430 /></span> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3836910?t=1760025509","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3836910?t=1760025509","capsule_image":"https: